'''Grandpa Wolf's Cave''' is a location found in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}. It is home to {{NPCSprite|Grandpa Wolf}}, who gives out rewards for opening [[Frozen Corpses]] in {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}.

